.el .ds Aq '
.TH ferry-peer-add 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-peer\-add \- Add a device by TICKET or Node ID and send it a pairing request
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry peer add\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-\-auto\-accept\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pair\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-alias\fR> <\fITICKET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a device by TICKET or Node ID and send it a pairing request
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-alias\fR \fI<ALIAS>\fR
Name for the device
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-\-auto\-accept\fR
Accept files from this device without asking
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pair\fR
Do not send a pairing request (trust only on this side)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITICKET\fR>
TICKET or Node ID of the device
